# The scripted validators of the stage 3 demo (S-05 section 1), run by
# programs/validators. Each line is one act in one on-chain round:
#   round validator target score   the validator votes score on target
#   round validator opt-in         the validator opts itself in
# V1 to V3 bond in round 2, so they have stake at the start of round 3 and
# are seated from round 4 when they opt in. Their votes stand until replaced,
# so the claims of round 9 read them: M 500,000 (V1 and V2 vote 500,000, V3
# not at all), K 0 (V1 and V2 vote 0), N 1,000,000 (nobody votes on it).
3 V1 opt-in
3 V2 opt-in
3 V3 opt-in
4 V1 M 500000
4 V2 M 500000
4 V1 K 0
4 V2 K 0
